[1, ["b", "bn1006802329503024296"], ["u", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description"], ["l", "This property contains the most recent date on which the resource was changed or modified. No value may indicate that the resource has never changed after its initial publication, or that the date of the last modification is not known, or that the resource is continuously updated This property MUST only be set if the distributions (the actual data) that the dataset describes have been updated after it has been issued. In this case the property MUST contain the date of the last update. That way a person or institution using the data for an analysis or application will know when to update the report or application on their side. Inherited from dcat:Resource.", "en", ""]]
